# Generated plugin webview UI bundles — esbuild output, rebuilt from the sibling
# `.tsx` by each plugin's `build-ui.mjs` (run automatically during `pnpm bundle`).
# They are committed as distributable artifacts so a plugin folder is one self-contained
# unit; they must NOT be hand-formatted, or the pre-commit Prettier pass would fight the
# build and leave the tree perpetually dirty.
plugins/*/ui/*.js
# Same for a plugin's pre-bundled entry point (checkpoints ships `main.js` with its
# runtime dependency inlined, so the packaged plugin needs no `node_modules`).
plugins/*/main.mjs
